"widget": {"name": "top_k"}, "name": "top_k", "label": "top_k", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "top_k"}, {"widget": {"name": "top_p"}, "name": "top_p", "label": "top_p", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "top_p"}, {"widget": {"name": "min_p"}, "name": "min_p", "label": "min_p", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "min_p"}, {"widget": {"name": "typical_p"}, "name": "typical_p", "label": "typical_p", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "typical_p"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "repeat_penalty"}, "name": "repeat_penalty", "label": "repeat_penalty", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "repeat_penalty"}, {"widget": {"name": "frequency_penalty"}, "name": "frequency_penalty", "label": "frequency_penalty", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "frequency_penalty"}, {"widget": {"name": "presence_penalty"}, "name": "presence_penalty", "label": "presence_penalty", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "presence_penalty"}, {"widget": {"name": "mirostat_mode"}, "name": "mirostat_mode", "label": "mirostat_mode", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "mirostat_mode"}, {"widget": {"name": "mirostat_eta"}, "name": "mirostat_eta", "label": "mirostat_eta", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "mirostat_eta"}, {"widget": {"name": "mirostat_tau"}, "name": "mirostat_tau", "label": "mirostat_tau", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "mirostat_tau"}, {"widget": {"name": "state_uid"}, "name": "state_uid", "label": "state_uid", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "state_uid"}], "flags": {}, "id": 17, "type": "llama_cpp_parameters", "properties": {"cnr_id": "llama-cpp_vllm", "ver": "2d28817e12f912ec9e27ce83cf7610a477152185", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "aux_id": "lihaoyun6/ComfyUI-llama-cpp_vlm", "Node name for S&R": "llama_cpp_parameters"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [], "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [754.634765625, 180.1079864501953], "pos": [381.7290344238281, 1567.0499267578125], "widgets_values": ["```prompt\nMasterful cinematic relighting applying the Rembrandt lighting technique to the subject. Strictly preserve the original subject, pose, clothing, background composition, and details; do not add, delete, or modify any content other than lighting and shadows.\n\nLighting Setup:\n- Primary Light Source: Place a single, hard key light at approximately 45 degrees to the camera axis and slightly above the subject's eye level.\n- Shadow Pattern: Create a distinct, inverted triangle of light on the shadowed cheek, ensuring the edge of the triangle touches the nose shadow, characteristic of Rembrandt lighting.\n- Fill Light: Use a very low-intensity fill or none to maintain a high contrast ratio, leaving the opposite side of the face in deep shadow.\n- Rim/Kicker Light: Add a subtle warm rim light on the hair and shoulder edge opposite the key light to separate the subject from the background.\n- Color Temperature: Cool, neutral daylight for the key light (approx. 5600K) contrasting with a slightly warmer tone in the shadow areas to enhance depth and drama.\n- Shadows: Deep, well-defined shadows with soft edges only where physically accurate for the light source size.\n\nGoal: Transform the image into a classic, dramatic portrait with a sense of mystery and artistic depth while keeping the subject's identity and scene perfectly intact.\n```"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 23, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 19, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "a3f051f0c3557257fbf62839ed1a4a2442b1ed40", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "llama_model", "links": [24], "label": "llama_model", "type": "LLAMACPPMODEL", "localized_name": "llama_model"}], "size": [282.574951171875, 202], "po